; Freeplay extras: leaders' things. Idea, flash drive texts, stash coordinates: SGM (Sigerous Mod 3.10, GeJorge, deserve_items / sgm_deserves).
; Adaptation SRP Freeplay: Eon. A leader carries a flash drive (dv_<name>_case); "using" it creates a stash (inventory_box) at
; deserve_pos (x,y,z,level_vertex,game_vertex) with deserve_items and a map spot. Items are only what exists in the game
; (SGM's own variants are replaced by their base sections; balance is for later). Effect: scripts\fp_deserves.script.
; deserve_items: section[,count]; for ammo the count is rounds.

